{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:53","answer":"黄金比例","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我得到了一句很长的英文提示，但是不知道如何理解","html":"<p>提取本题图里符合【那句英语提示】的字母。这里【相交】指的是<strong>颜色</strong>和原网格一致。</p>","text":"提取本题图里符合【那句英语提示】的字母。这里【相交】指的是\n颜色\n和原网格一致。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>首先要找出8行4列共12个词（可能有倒序的！）。这些词可以对应右边的颜色。</p>","text":"首先要找出8行4列共12个词（可能有倒序的！）。这些词可以对应右边的颜色。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>每组三字母在确定行列单词后会有两个字母【染上对应单词颜色】，结合那句很长的提示，和火药区meta中的焰色进行操作。</p>","text":"每组三字母在确定行列单词后会有两个字母【染上对应单词颜色】，结合那句很长的提示，和火药区meta中的焰色进行操作。","assetIds":[]},{"number":4,"title":"请直接告诉我【很长的英文提示】是什么","html":"<p>take intersection with original grid</p>","text":"take intersection with original grid","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"GOLD RATIO","messageHtml":"<p>这是一个里程碑</p>","messageText":"这是一个里程碑","extraHtml":"","extraText":"","assetIds":[]},{"answer":"TAKE INTERSECTION WITH ORIGINAL GRID","messageHtml":"<p>这是正确的</p>","messageText":"这是正确的","extraHtml":"","extraText":"","assetIds":[]}],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>首先可以在矩阵里找到一些有明确颜色的物品的词，为了方便确认，所有的词对应的颜色按照字母表顺序给出：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>紫：BEET</li>\n<li>黑：CROW</li>\n<li>白：GARDENIA</li>\n<li>橙：IRON RUST</li>\n<li>绿：LEAF</li>\n<li>绿：LIME</li>\n<li>红：LIPS</li>\n<li>白：MILK</li>\n<li>绿：OKRA</li>\n<li>黄：OLIVE OIL</li>\n<li>蓝：SAPPHIRE</li>\n<li>黑：SUMI</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"字母颜色grid\" data-asset-id=\"asset-81d725693475b74205e5c8b4\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/27c05cbaff194912b9ffb4752f468c57.webp\"/></p>\n<p>读未用到的字母得到 TAKE INTERSECTION WITH ORIGINAL GRID。这里 original grid 指的是火药区 meta 所用到的颜色格子：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"焰色\" data-asset-id=\"asset-f7f5f421723584f6578f9bce\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/460c85c5de9949549cd7b404ba900008.webp\"/></p>\n<p>这里 intersection （相交）指的是看字母颜色和格子颜色一致的位置，例如第一行第二格在火药 meta 里为白色，提取其中同为白色的字母 G（来自gardenia）。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"提取\" data-asset-id=\"asset-17a1bc54556fa647c7278501\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/fa2fee421750424a96ad498edf9ccc74.webp\"/></p>\n<p>从上到下提取的字母为 GOLD RATIO，根据字数提示（四）可以翻译成最终答案<code>黄金比例</code>。</p>","text":"首先可以在矩阵里找到一些有明确颜色的物品的词，为了方便确认，所有的词对应的颜色按照字母表顺序给出：\n\n紫：BEET\n\n黑：CROW\n\n白：GARDENIA\n\n橙：IRON RUST\n\n绿：LEAF\n\n绿：LIME\n\n红：LIPS\n\n白：MILK\n\n绿：OKRA\n\n黄：OLIVE OIL\n\n蓝：SAPPHIRE\n\n黑：SUMI\n\n读未用到的字母得到 TAKE INTERSECTION WITH ORIGINAL GRID。这里 original grid 指的是火药区 meta 所用到的颜色格子：\n\n这里 intersection （相交）指的是看字母颜色和格子颜色一致的位置，例如第一行第二格在火药 meta 里为白色，提取其中同为白色的字母 G（来自gardenia）。\n\n从上到下提取的字母为 GOLD RATIO，根据字数提示（四）可以翻译成最终答案\n黄金比例\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-17a1bc54556fa647c7278501","asset-81d725693475b74205e5c8b4","asset-f7f5f421723584f6578f9bce"]},"extended":{"html":"<p>@{##u##}突然明白过来，要做出最好看的烟花，就要在燃料里加入正确比例的黄金，不能因为太多而显得俗气，也不能因为太少而有失身份。@{##u##}找到7k+的配方，计算出了正确的黄金比例，终于做出了低调又不失奢华的黄金烟火。</p>","text":"@{##u##}突然明白过来，要做出最好看的烟花，就要在燃料里加入正确比例的黄金，不能因为太多而显得俗气，也不能因为太少而有失身份。@{##u##}找到7k+的配方，计算出了正确的黄金比例，终于做出了低调又不失奢华的黄金烟火。","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{"html":"<p>每行和每列各有一个单词/词组，注意有可能是从右到左/从下往上。</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/3b9f7681fa8a48aeba709b4167b98232.webp\">\n\n<p>（四）"},"sourceMetadata":{"desc":"火药树","type":1,"answer_type":0,"extend_data":"{\"pid\":53,\"imgUrl\":\"7847cd97b0ab4a1d94166ac4d6237097.webp\",\"color\":\"#000\",\"top\":\"17px\",\"left\":\"960px\"}","pgid":6,"pg_name":"终章","resolved_extend_assets":["https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/7847cd97b0ab4a1d94166ac4d6237097.webp"]},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-1321b02ba7d7eaf2b6c12fb7","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/7847cd97b0ab4a1d94166ac4d6237097.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/7847cd97b0ab4a1d94166ac4d6237097.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":40066,"sha256":"77c1b9c8ef28d9faa0faf8268b7ac7c59ec08c1168c53d45c22236e9bf46f13a","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["sourceMetadata"]},{"id":"asset-17a1bc54556fa647c7278501","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/fa2fee421750424a96ad498edf9ccc74.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/fa2fee421750424a96ad498edf9ccc74.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":57476,"sha256":"f6acb473117d24a4675c293ec09588a8d0fa9893f1edfea6c68fef9af5d5690f","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-1a0f81ae3c168ac42c547025","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/3b9f7681fa8a48aeba709b4167b98232.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/3b9f7681fa8a48aeba709b4167b98232.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":33540,"sha256":"e13dc8ca559f50355eed0e342a670a0259ca753825c0abc04ed14afe9f5e96fd","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["interactive"]},{"id":"asset-81d725693475b74205e5c8b4","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/27c05cbaff194912b9ffb4752f468c57.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/27c05cbaff194912b9ffb4752f468c57.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":70454,"sha256":"2c69b4290d6b36ddf698b7e97bc091d8f5c587feb67fff790bbc75e4c12280b9","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-f7f5f421723584f6578f9bce","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/460c85c5de9949549cd7b404ba900008.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/460c85c5de9949549cd7b404ba900008.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":2892,"sha256":"984b0b12bcd27095f24721a110424ff99fe0dfb2a99d98830f40a3ea703388b1","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
